// Rimehold: a survival map for four defenders, all of it arctic. The
// defenders' starts stand close together on the hold, an upland of snowbound
// tundra ringed by open water; four ways cross the water, one from each
// side: the Causeway, a neck of land, east from the Progenitor's base, which
// stands at grade on the mainland facing west down it; and three hard-light
// bridges, north from the highlands, south from the fells and west from Wester
// Isle, their decks high enough for ships to sail under (the map's decks). The
// sea runs round the hold but for the Causeway; Shaper slips in the ocean and
// on both lagoons either side of the Causeway, and a sea gate of the base's on
// each lagoon. Shaper sites in every region, the auxiliary Shapers hidden behind
// them. Nothing grows.
// Positions are metres, x east, y north, from the south-west corner. They
// match crates/mc-map/src/bake/rimehold.rs (its `rimehold_block` test prints
// the facility block and the sites); crates/mc-map/tests/rimehold.rs holds
// them to the baked terrain.
